# itemlog-events: the append-only event log beside itemlog.rec. Folding it# reproduces every Item there (`itemlog check`). Write only through `itemlog`.

%rec: Event
%doc: 
+ One line of the append-only log. Folding a repo's events in At order
+ (file order breaks ties) reproduces its Items: the first event for an Item
+ creates it with Slug = Item; an event sets Field to its Value; an event
+ with no Value clears Field. For a repeatable field (DependsOn, By, Link)
+ the event's Value lines are the field's whole new list. The fold is
+ last-writer-wins per field.
%mandatory: Item At Agent Field
%allowed: Item At Agent Field Value
%unique: Item At Agent Field
%typedef: Slug_t regexp /^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$/
%typedef: Agent_t regexp #^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,63}(/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+)?$#
%typedef: Stamp_t regexp /^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}Z$/
%type: Item Slug_t
%type: Agent Agent_t
%type: At Stamp_t
%type: Field enum Type Status Owner Title Definition Created Updated Repo MovedTo BlockedOn Asks AskId Answer AnsweredBy Trigger DependsOn Parent Plan Priority Due Progress ProgressAt By Model Evidence Source Link Started Paused Ended

