Agent: mcp-starter-template
Field: Answer
Value: eqstack, 2026-10-15 15:48 (bus xiGNE4FHl3B0): the error is real, verbatim from George's paste 2026-10-07 09:54Z:
+ "Error: Tool 'resolve_conversation' has an invalid outputSchema: JSON Schema declares an unsupported dialect ("$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"). The default validator supports JSON Schema 2020-12 only; pass a pre-configured Ajv instance to AjvJs"
+ Server imsg-mcp 1.25.5 (before the #184 strip). Surface and version unknown; the string ships in CC 2.1.300 and Claude Desktop 2.37337.1, Desktop is the likely surface. Does NOT reproduce with claude -p on 2.1.300 (draft-07 input+output schemas with structuredContent passed). PICK: strip $schema now, kit 3 on each consumer's own schedule; an Ajv2020 strict compile (kit 3 /testing) is the guard.

